    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Choose Better Words\r\n\r\nThis chatbot will help you choose more interesting words in your writing.\r\n\r\n1. Choose one the purposes for using AI that you identified.\r\n\r\n2. Test this chatbot to see how well it helps with that purpose.\r\n\r\n   **Prompt example:** I'm trying to write a hip hop song and I need help with rhymes for these words: crew, logic, happy\r\n\r\n3. Judge what AI did well and what it did not do well.\r\n",
